Framegen (FG-Legacy frame generation)
=====================================

OpenNOW's local frame generation, called FG-Legacy, is built on Framegen, the
real-time neural frame interpolation project by MONZik: the interpolator design,
pacing rules and capability test follow the Framegen runtime (JavaScript/WGSL,
ported to Qt/QRhi), and the model weights are the unchanged Framegen v7-small
release. Notices live under third_party/framegen/. FG-Legacy is planned to be
replaced by the FlyHigh project from the same author.

https://github.com/MONZikWasTaken/Framegen

